# Generated by Cargo
/target
debug/

# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: this crate ships a binary,
# and a tracked lockfile gives reproducible builds.

# Backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these (debugging information)
*.pdb

# cargo-mutants mutation-testing output
**/mutants.out*/

# Local secrets (HCLOUD_TOKEN etc.) - never commit
.env
.env.*

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors / IDEs
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
